{"texts": ["4", "x", "the", " ", "42", "x y", "a b c", "2+2=4", "Let x be a positive integer.", "A train left a station $A$ for $B$ at $13:00$. At $19:00$ the train was brought to a halt by a snow drift. $2$ hours later the railway line was cleared, and to make up for the lost time, the train proceeded at a speed exceeding the original speed by $20\\%$ and arrived at $B$ only $1$ hour later. The next day, a train going from $A$ to $B$ according to the same timetable was stopped by a snow drift $150\\,\\text{km}$ farther from $A$ than the former train. Likewise, after a $2$-hour halt, it went with a $20\\%$ increase of speed but failed to make up for the lost time and arrived at $B$ $1$ hour $30$ minutes late. Find the distance between $A$ and $B$.", "$A$, $B$, $13:00$, $19:00$, $2$, $20\\%$, $B$, $1$, $A$, $B$, $150\\,\\text{km}$, $A$, $2$, $20\\%$, $B$, $1$, $30$, $A$, $B$", "$4.30$ $\\sin$ $10$ $\\alpha$ $\\sin$ $8$ $\\alpha$ $+$ $\\sin$ $8$ $\\alpha$ $\\sin$ $6$ $\\alpha$ $-$ $\\sin$ $4$ $\\alpha$ $\\sin$ $2$ $\\alpha$.", "$4.30$, $\\sin$, $10$, $\\alpha$, $\\sin$, $8$, $\\alpha$, $+$, $\\sin$, $8$, $\\alpha$, $\\sin$, $6$, $\\alpha$, $-$, $\\sin$, $4$, $\\alpha$, $\\sin$, $2$, $\\alpha$", "\u05d4\u05d5\u05db\u05d9\u05d7\u05d5 \u05db\u05d9 \u05e2\u05d1\u05d5\u05e8 $a>0,\\; b>0,\\; c>0$ \u05de\u05ea\u05e7\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd $$\\frac{a^2}{b}+\\frac{b^2}{c}+\\frac{c^2}{a}\\ge\\frac{\\dfrac{(a+c)^2}{b+c}+\\dfrac{(b+a)^2}{c+a}+\\dfrac{(c+b)^2}{a+b}}{2}.$$"], "ntok": [2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 4, 6, 8, 198, 81, 66, 68, 95], "cos": [{"lasttoken": 0.5568153740144755, "mean": 0.5752973020670791, "cls": 0.12773438694472658, "eos": 0.5621382088524832}, {"lasttoken": 0.6769002606804733, "mean": 0.5434452775870098, "cls": 0.08583624942676528, "eos": 0.6595410551400934}, {"lasttoken": 0.6373621385064933, "mean": 0.5569715829221924, "cls": 0.09764009706295422, "eos": 0.6036329656726485}, {"lasttoken": 0.5822510193489945, "mean": 0.589085310897212, "cls": 0.10698093101725163, "eos": 0.56